Dialogue: 2,0:17:31.74,0:17:32.53,MainJP,,0,0,0,,なに
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.83,RoleLeftCN,*,0,0,0,,好大…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.83,RoleLeftJP,*,0,0,0,,おっき…
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.32,0:17:41.50,RoleRightCN,*,0,0,0,,舞舞氏 快溜啊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.32,0:17:41.50,RoleRightJP,*,0,0,0,,舞舞氏 逃げねば
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.38,0:17:50.55,MainCN,,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.38,0:17:50.55,MainJP,,0,0,0,,なんね
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.82,0:18:13.86,MainCN,,0,0,0,,这是啥情况啊
Dialogue: 2,0:18:09.82,0:18:13.86,MainJP,,0,0,0,,どやんなとうと—
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.05,0:18:21.26,MainCN,,0,0,0,,啥玩意 那么大
Dialogue: 2,0:18:19.05,0:18:21.26,MainJP,*,0,0,0,,な…なんね デッカ—
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.65,MainCN,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.65,MainJP,,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.45,0:18:28.34,MainCN,,0,0,0,,那样子的万博纪念碑 之前有吗
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.45,0:18:28.34,MainJP,,0,0,0,,あがん万博のモニュメント あったか
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.33,0:18:38.64,MainCN,,0,0,0,,大家 大大家
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.33,0:18:38.64,MainJP,,0,0,0,,皆さん み皆さん
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.33,0:18:40.02,MainCN,,0,0,0,,紧急事…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:39.33,0:18:40.02,MainJP,,0,0,0,,緊急事
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.14,MainCN,*,0,0,0,,鲷！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.14,MainJP,,0,0,0,,タイです
