Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.22,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.22,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}手を 銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.81,0:11:47.60,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.81,0:11:47.60,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}手を 銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.82,0:11:51.53,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.82,0:11:51.53,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}手を 銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.08,0:11:55.96,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.08,0:11:55.96,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}手を 銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.00,0:12:00.01,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.00,0:12:00.01,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}手を 銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.36,0:12:04.29,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}将手伸向银河吧
Dialogue: 2,0:12:00.36,0:12:04.29,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}手を 銀河へ伸ばそう
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.88,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}来吧 将彼此的手紧紧相连
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.88,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}さあ 手と手 繋いで
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.56,0:12:12.30,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}让佐贺走向全世界
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.56,0:12:12.30,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}サガを 世界へ
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.13,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}YES SAGA
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.13,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFE8A2&}YES サガ
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.06,0:12:25.14,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}在闪烁的宇宙里（Hey）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.06,0:12:25.14,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}またたく宇宙[そら]に（Hey ）
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.04,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}向往着（渴慕着）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.04,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}憧れて（焦がれ）
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.23,0:12:29.31,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}前人未至的（Ho）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.23,0:12:29.31,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}前人未到の（Ho）
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.44,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}旅途仍在继续（迈向旅程）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.44,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9980FF&}旅は続く（旅へ）
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.11,BGTopCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDEC4B0&}纵是看似痴心妄想（Hey）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.11,BGTopJP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDEC4B0&}妄想幻想じみた（Hey）
